{"term": {"label": "愛", "occurrences": 5, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "一", "id": "一"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "何", "id": "何"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "姓", "id": "姓"}, {"form": "孰", "id": "孰"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "易", "id": "易"}, {"form": "楚", "id": "楚"}, {"form": "牛", "id": "牛"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "百", "id": "百"}, {"form": "羊", "id": "羊"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "齊", "id": "齊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.8111223862420243, "source": "愛", "target": "姓"}, {"weight": 0.5903673114956106, "source": "愛", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.9844438130575563, "source": "愛", "target": "百"}, {"weight": 1.8666607774011728, "source": "愛", "target": "一"}, {"weight": 0.7139812674627873, "source": "愛", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.2605249738308573, "source": "愛", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.048982334195127, "source": "愛", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "愛", "target": "齊"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "愛", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "愛", "target": "易"}, {"weight": 2.048982334195127, "source": "愛", "target": "羊"}, {"weight": 0.12036368224987509, "source": "齊", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.495269436823547, "source": "齊", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "齊", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.782951509275328, "source": "齊", "target": "一"}, {"weight": 0.9371248187769972, "source": "齊", "target": "何"}, {"weight": 1.483668525145067, "source": "齊", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "齊", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "聞", "target": "事"}